  "sourceTitle": "Introducing Anthropic models on Amazon Bedrock for in-region inference in Seoul and Singapore",
  "sourceBodyHash": "35ee6b9112ae5406cd11fc9c9a8c8f43e836fe927d7adf729217b783c2355218",
